{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PacaPomo is a cross between a productivity app and a cozy farming game where you raise alpacas and cultivate a farm, all driven by the Pomodoro Technique! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stay focused with a calming and motivating experience for busy students and working professionals. Play while going about your daily routines and responsibilities!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stay Productive with PacaPomo!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set a pomodoro timer customizable to your liking. Focus on an IRL task set to cozy Peruvian inspired music. When you come back, you're rewarded with crops ready to be harvested\u00a0and Alpacas happy to great you!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/extras/b1bcf917336fc4761639b26b180b8f41.poster.avif?t=1756228967\" width=780 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/extras/b1bcf917336fc4761639b26b180b8f41.webm?t=1756228967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/extras/b1bcf917336fc4761639b26b180b8f41.mp4?t=1756228967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nurture your Garden!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant various local specialties to feed your alpacas with, or sell them for a bit of extra cash! You can also complete villager orders for a large prize, or cook unique meals\u00a0with your crops to treat your Alpacas.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/extras/d9da11abd51f7ce7ce957b0e6e4a74fa.poster.avif?t=1756228967\" width=780 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/extras/d9da11abd51f7ce7ce957b0e6e4a74fa.webm?t=1756228967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/extras/d9da11abd51f7ce7ce957b0e6e4a74fa.mp4?t=1756228967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adopt and Care for your Alpacas!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you finish a pomodoro, you can take some time to pet your alpacas! Feed, shear, train and bond with your new friends.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/extras/0f67a7bdd50dfd5ab44abbfec855f6b5.poster.avif?t=1756228967\" width=780 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/extras/0f67a7bdd50dfd5ab44abbfec855f6b5.webm?t=1756228967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/extras/0f67a7bdd50dfd5ab44abbfec855f6b5.mp4?t=1756228967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand your Farm!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open up new terraces to unlock orchards, more alpaca pen space, and garden plots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/extras/c7740173b376130f94ccc63a6e89346a.poster.avif?t=1756228967\" width=800 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/extras/c7740173b376130f94ccc63a6e89346a.webm?t=1756228967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/extras/c7740173b376130f94ccc63a6e89346a.mp4?t=1756228967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take advantage of the Pomodoro Timer for focus time, allowing you to stick to a schedule and improve concentration. You can customize your timer to your liking - with different times, tags, and long break options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A report card to track your progress on a daily, weekly, and monthly chart. Alongside is a To-Do List that you can fill out to track your goals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique, bespoke alpacas with different personalities and stories. These are acquired through adoption at the Alpaca Sanctuary. Every encounter is an exciting new addition to your farm!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization options for Alpacas - allowing you to dress up your friends with silly hats, glasses, and special effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun short minigames for interacting with your alpacas, including sheering and cooking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original, calming soundtrack made by Peruvian musicians to chill or lock in to.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A selection of unique crops and fruits to grow and harvest. Feed them to your alpacas, use them in food recipes, or complete villager orders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long term progression through farm expansion - save up to buy terrace plots that will allow you to unlock orchards, more alpaca pen space and farming plots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross-platform cloud saves to ensure your progress is never lost!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In today's fast-paced world, many struggle to balance work, responsibilities, and leisure time. PacaPomo aims to address this challenge by offering a free, fun and accessible way for people to relax and unwind while also being productive.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I'm ready!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2921870/66992c81f7274771a38421b724e84c578adf3a68.jpg"},{"name":"Focused","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2921870/29b2e1609b3fa943f49d331006dd8a822c0e88b9.jpg"},{"name":"Driven","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2921870/242f1ef711eec1a35c085172cdb554c690fc0fe7.jpg"},{"name":"Farm fresh","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2921870/387c81b4e82ea4154a41b6086d3e4679a9422f0d.jpg"},{"name":"Industry's booming!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2921870/369df3fa4dc7bf160be06a2d205f7b6222a1cb3c.jpg"},{"name":"Fresh cut","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2921870/3ad5f1ff5ca4695a475c50ed988a9f038c510742.jpg"},{"name":"Hey, knock it off!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2921870/6a932be023b0e94256e2c98f80f1e3c802db4588.jpg"},{"name":"Lucky!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2921870/62381352cea9508e657013d2ff149126f192b4a7.jpg"},{"name":"The more, the merrier!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2921870/f53b1238fd85b3693c2ea034d2fa9946d6ff770f.jpg"},{"name":"Full House","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2921870/d044c71904f85f4c410db43bc6d10c5f8ea27a05.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2921870?t=1756228967","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756228967","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756228967","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756228967","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PacaPomo is a cross between a productivity app and a cozy farming game where you raise alpacas and cultivate a farm, all driven by the Pomodoro Technique! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stay focused with a calming and motivating experience for busy students and working professionals. Play while going about your daily routines and responsibilities!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stay Productive with PacaPomo!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set a pomodoro timer customizable to your liking. Focus on an IRL task set to cozy Peruvian inspired music. When you come back, you're rewarded with crops ready to be harvested\u00a0and Alpacas happy to great you!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/extras/b1bcf917336fc4761639b26b180b8f41.poster.avif?t=1756228967\" width=780 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/extras/b1bcf917336fc4761639b26b180b8f41.webm?t=1756228967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/extras/b1bcf917336fc4761639b26b180b8f41.mp4?t=1756228967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nurture your Garden!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant various local specialties to feed your alpacas with, or sell them for a bit of extra cash! You can also complete villager orders for a large prize, or cook unique meals\u00a0with your crops to treat your Alpacas.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/extras/d9da11abd51f7ce7ce957b0e6e4a74fa.poster.avif?t=1756228967\" width=780 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/extras/d9da11abd51f7ce7ce957b0e6e4a74fa.webm?t=1756228967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/extras/d9da11abd51f7ce7ce957b0e6e4a74fa.mp4?t=1756228967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adopt and Care for your Alpacas!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you finish a pomodoro, you can take some time to pet your alpacas! Feed, shear, train and bond with your new friends.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/extras/0f67a7bdd50dfd5ab44abbfec855f6b5.poster.avif?t=1756228967\" width=780 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/extras/0f67a7bdd50dfd5ab44abbfec855f6b5.webm?t=1756228967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/extras/0f67a7bdd50dfd5ab44abbfec855f6b5.mp4?t=1756228967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand your Farm!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open up new terraces to unlock orchards, more alpaca pen space, and garden plots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/extras/c7740173b376130f94ccc63a6e89346a.poster.avif?t=1756228967\" width=800 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/extras/c7740173b376130f94ccc63a6e89346a.webm?t=1756228967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/extras/c7740173b376130f94ccc63a6e89346a.mp4?t=1756228967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take advantage of the Pomodoro Timer for focus time, allowing you to stick to a schedule and improve concentration. You can customize your timer to your liking - with different times, tags, and long break options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A report card to track your progress on a daily, weekly, and monthly chart. Alongside is a To-Do List that you can fill out to track your goals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique, bespoke alpacas with different personalities and stories. These are acquired through adoption at the Alpaca Sanctuary. Every encounter is an exciting new addition to your farm!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization options for Alpacas - allowing you to dress up your friends with silly hats, glasses, and special effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun short minigames for interacting with your alpacas, including sheering and cooking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original, calming soundtrack made by Peruvian musicians to chill or lock in to.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A selection of unique crops and fruits to grow and harvest. Feed them to your alpacas, use them in food recipes, or complete villager orders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long term progression through farm expansion - save up to buy terrace plots that will allow you to unlock orchards, more alpaca pen space and farming plots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross-platform cloud saves to ensure your progress is never lost!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In today's fast-paced world, many struggle to balance work, responsibilities, and leisure time. PacaPomo aims to address this challenge by offering a free, fun and accessible way for people to relax and unwind while also being productive.</p>","developers":["Sweet Spot Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921870/header.jpg?t=1756228967","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257187075,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187075/movie480.mp4?t=1755847561","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187075/movie_max.mp4?t=1755847561"},"name":"PacaPomo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257187075/970df4a90bbb9782fce51b3a602867e21f4c8c1f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755847561","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187075/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755847561","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187075/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755847561"}}],"name":"PacaPomo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-14600K | AMD Ryzen 5 7600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 950 | Radeon HD7870<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Sto